  "title": "Lumexa Imaging Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call Date",
  "summary": "Lumexa Imaging (Nasdaq: LMRI), one of the nation’s largest providers of outpatient imaging services, today announced it will release its second quarter 2026 financial and operational results after market close on Wednesday, August 12, 2026. The Company will host a conference call and live webcast to discuss the results at 5:00 p.m. ET.",
